pq4Y?t=943","https://youtu.be/QbdrhJd7LiA?t=1708"]},{"field":"mpg","text":"Joe projects 27 to 28 minutes. The newest note worries about only about 24 under Iisalo's short stints, so I set 26.5.","sources":["https://youtu.be/LcZcvk8s1xQ?t=1667","https://youtu.be/bd8GYKFOe8A?t=995"]},{"field":"late_games_out","text":"A 29-year-old veteran on a bottom team that rested him late last season. He is also a trade candidate. Small rest risk in March.","sources":["https://youtu.be/lp11OAEpq4Y?t=1912","https://youtu.be/lp11OAEpq4Y?t=419"]},{"field":"gp","text":"I kept Yahoo's 65. That number already reflects his calf injury and a history of seasons lost to injury.","sources":["https://youtu.be/KPdD91Oo8-U?t=2451"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}